blackboard 1
# What the guard scene's agents know (see docs/ai/README.md#the-sample). Their perception fills the intruder that they
# perceive, whether they see it and where it was, and the last noise that they heard and where. Their decisions write
# whether they search, and their actions where they patrol to. Health is the wary one's, which a stone lowers.
entity target
bool can_see_target
position last_seen
entity noise
position noise_at
bool searching
position waypoint
float health = 100
